# Architectuur Planner

## Frontend
Vue + TypeScript + Pinia + Vue Flow

## Backend
Express + TypeScript + MongoDB

## Run frontend
cd frontend
npm run dev

## Run backend
cd backend
npm run dev

## Build frontend
The build needs the address of the backend in `VITE_API_URL`: copy `frontend/.env.example` to `frontend/.env.production` and fill it in, or set it in the environment of the build.

cd frontend
npm run build

## Run backend in production
The backend needs the address of the frontend in `CORS_ORIGINS`, and `NODE_ENV=production`. See `backend/.env.example` for all settings.
